| Simon Mansfield, Igor Soarez | 3 each |
| Benjamin Eidelman, Mathias Buus, Eric di Domenico, Alberto Leal, Saad Tazi | 2–3 each |
| Tom Arad, Shane Tomlinson, Hannah Wolfe, Eran Tiktin, Chima Alaebo | 1 each |

### Key Takeaways
1. Troy Goode is both the original author and the main contributor (29 of 62 commits). About 159 of roughly 250 lines are still his, so the structure has barely changed since 2013–2015.
2. Doug Wilson shaped how the file behaves in edge cases: `Vary`, a missing `methods` option, and lint. Alejandro Caravaca Puchades added the RegExp/array origin matching.
3. Don't trust plain `git blame` here. Use `git blame --ignore-rev 62628c0 lib/index.js`. Adding that commit to a `.git-blame-ignore-revs` file would fix it permanently.

